# ETERNAL ORCHESTRATIONS: ContinueAsNew
# Demo interval: 15 seconds (production: 15 minutes).

# URL and keys come from http-client.env.json. Local values are the default; to test the deployed app, choose azure at the top right of this editor.

### 1. Start the forever-loop for partner "acme"
POST {{baseUrl}}/eternal/partners/acme/start?intervalSeconds=15
x-functions-key: {{functionKey}}

### 2. Call start again → still ONE instance (singleton)
POST {{baseUrl}}/eternal/partners/acme/start?intervalSeconds=15
x-functions-key: {{functionKey}}

### 3. Status: same instance ID; customStatus.Generation goes up every 15 seconds
GET {{hostUrl}}/runtime/webhooks/durabletask/instances/partner-sync-acme?code={{systemKey}}

### 4. History stays tiny: only the current generation's events, however long it has run
GET {{hostUrl}}/runtime/webhooks/durabletask/instances/partner-sync-acme?showHistory=true&code={{systemKey}}

### 5. Stop it
POST {{baseUrl}}/eternal/partners/acme/stop
x-functions-key: {{functionKey}}
